{"id": "DdieDr7kxUw", "title": "Video by kahiyo.in", "description": "द्वारकाधीश… चोर? हत्यारा? 💎\n\nएक मणि, जो रोज़ सोना देती थी।\nउसके लिए एक आदमी की जान गई… और पूरी द्वारका ने उँगली उठाई श्रीकृष्ण पर।\nकृष्ण ने बहस नहीं की। कहा— \"तो सच… मैं ख़ुद ढूँढूँगा।\"\n\nस्यमंतक · एपिसोड 1 — \"इल्ज़ाम\"\n\nअगला एपिसोड देखने के लिए फ़ॉलो करें 🔔\nजब सब आप पर ही शक करें, तो आप क्या करेंगे? कमेंट में बताइए 👇\n\n🙏 भागवत पुराण और विष्णु पुराण की स्यमंतक मणि कथा पर आधारित।\n\n#Syamantaka #स्यमंतक #SyamantakaMani #Krishna #श्रीकृष्ण #Dwarka #BhagavataPurana #HinduMythology #Mythology #IndianMythology #SanatanDharma #HindiStory #HindiReels #MicroDrama #Kahiyo #DesiStories #ReelsIndia #JaiShriKrishna", "channel": "kahiyo.in", "uploader_id": "32047977584", "uploader": "Kahiyo", "timestamp": 1789970555, "like_count": 58, "comment_count": 1, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-18105227162065585a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 66.823, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMQAbFevwIx_1vW8fLX-1raft_67vU57dL2BPwB11WlyM3kT5Llxqz-o4l2bqcNdm1ECffuzq5iAUd76yLE1M-qapCMi2UygeEHLwU.mp4?_nc_cat=108&_nc_oc=AdoMysRhn0F4M384TIn9QVuaaWvPYKD1S2-g1eMQlklav3N6AM5T2HZWi0BizzsI3gmMSsq0I35vdhMlSIN1vrPo&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=QD0TAgl12OMQ7kNvwEpBmnK&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=Wx-Fg9fPpdp8ITMLowTY_g&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQTY7XPJJaBy8Hsq0P3t7I1G0fzLsH5F_geehNSfagERRA&oe=6AF444D1", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 66.823, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/150.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "